  "description": "Proposed site for new dwelling\rG1-5x Mixed species\rFell as close to ground level as possible.  Grind out stump to 200mm below ground level.\r\rG1 Mixed Species Trees have decay at the base and in decline\rSome have failed and are hung up in the neighbours trees\r\rT1-Cherry\rFell as close to ground level as possible. Grind out stump to 200mm below ground level.\r\rT1 Dead Cherry the tree is of poor shape and form and is of low amenity value\rThere are several other desirable and dominant trees of better shape and form within close proximity to the subject tree\r\rT2-Birch\rFell as close to ground level as possible. Grind out stump to 200mm below ground level.\r\rT2 Dead Birch the tree is of poor shape and form and is of low amenity value\rThere are several other desirable and dominant trees of better shape and form within close proximity to the subject tree\r\rT3-Oak and Sycamore\rCut back limbs- client will advise\r\rT3 Oak + Sycamore \rWorks will encourage a well balanced crown for future years\rWorks will encourage an even distribution of growth throughout the crown\rThe specified works will enhance the overall aesthetics of the tree",
